   Group Key: (length((stringu1)::text))
   ->  Gather
         Workers Planned: 4
         ->  Partial HashAggregate  (work_mem=N kB) (limit=40960 kB)
               Group Key: length((stringu1)::text)
               ->  Parallel Seq Scan on tenk1
